### Retrieve live guided anomaly investigations

GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/investigations
Accept: application/json

### Get sensors for command testing

GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Accept: application/json

### Queue normal status command

POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensorId": "32a1bd4e-9168-4ada-a917-59703a28def3",
  "type": 6,
  "priority": 1,
  "payload": "Return current device status"
}

### Queue critical restart command

POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensorId": "32a1bd4e-9168-4ada-a917-59703a28def3",
  "type": 1,
  "priority": 3,
  "payload": "Emergency restart after telemetry failure"
}

### Get command queue summary

GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands/summary
Accept: application/json

### Process first command — should process Critical first

POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands/process-next
Accept: application/json

### Process second command — should process Normal second

POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands/process-next
Accept: application/json

### Undo last completed command — should undo Normal command

POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands/undo
Accept: application/json

### Get command history

GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands
Accept: application/json

### Get chronological command timeline

GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/commands/timeline
Accept: application/json

### Get automatic predictive recommendations

GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations
Accept: application/json

### Analyse first power-related operator query

POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations/analyse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Investigate power spike"
}

### Analyse second power-related operator query

POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations/analyse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Check power usage"
}

