GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations/query-patterns
Accept: application/json

### Query moisture history using the AVL index
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/sensor/dfddd6d1-cc89-47c7-9785-9db4009c6085/range?fromUtc=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-10-06T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Reject reversed date boundaries
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/sensor/dfddd6d1-cc89-47c7-9785-9db4009c6085/range?fromUtc=2026-10-06T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Reject missing date boundaries
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/sensor/dfddd6d1-cc89-47c7-9785-9db4009c6085/range
Accept: application/json

### Handle an unknown sensor
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/sensor/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/range?fromUtc=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-10-06T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Return only readings 3, 4 and 5
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/sensor/dfddd6d1-cc89-47c7-9785-9db4009c6085/range?fromUtc=2026-08-30T13:04:30Z&toUtc=2026-08-30T13:04:41Z
Accept: application/json

### Get the persisted mesh network
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology
Accept: application/json

### BFS connectivity
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/connectivity/810a5286-2ef0-4f33-b6a3-46c7e886ccd7
Accept: application/json

### Minimum spanning tree
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/mst/810a5286-2ef0-4f33-b6a3-46c7e886ccd7
Accept: application/json

### Fewest-hop route from Main Utility Power Meter
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/route/810a5286-2ef0-4f33-b6a3-46c7e886ccd7?macAddress=A4:CF:12:9B:20:02
Accept: application/json

### Route through the minimum spanning tree
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/route/810a5286-2ef0-4f33-b6a3-46c7e886ccd7?macAddress=A4:CF:12:9B:20:02&useSpanningTree=true
Accept: application/json

### Simulate moisture relay failure and find an alternative route
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/route/810a5286-2ef0-4f33-b6a3-46c7e886ccd7?macAddress=A4:CF:12:9B:20:02&offlineNodeId=948860c8-7325-47ef-be16-375ab4b73950
Accept: application/json

### Recalculate MST with the moisture relay offline
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/topology/mst/810a5286-2ef0-4f33-b6a3-46c7e886ccd7?offlineNodeId=948860c8-7325-47ef-be16-375ab4b73950
Accept: application/json